{"id":"gotcha-example-001","type":"gotcha","fact":"Example: Truthy check on numeric values fails for explicit zero - if (value) is false when value === 0.","recommendation":"Use !== undefined or !== null instead of truthy checks when the value could legitimately be 0 or empty string.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"coderabbit","reference":"PR review","date":"2026-01-09"}],"tags":["javascript","type-coercion","validation"],"affectedFiles":["**/*.ts"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-09T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-09T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id": "gotcha-rn-android-font-weight-001", "type": "gotcha", "fact": "React Native Android resolves a bundled font by ASSET FILENAME, not by PostScript name: ReactFontManager appends one of EXTENSIONS ['', '_bold', '_italic', '_bold_italic'] to the fontFamily, and nearestStyle() collapses every numeric weight >= 700 onto '_bold'. A fontWeight of '500'/'600'/'800' therefore resolves to a file that does not exist and silently falls back to the system font with no warning in Metro or logcat.", "recommendation": "Never set fontWeight (style prop, StyleSheet, or a font-* Tailwind class) anywhere in mobile/src. Ship one font FILE per weight and select the weight by fontFamily alone, e.g. Inter-SemiBold as its own family. The typography tokens in mobile/src/theme/tokens.raw.js deliberately carry no fontWeight key and the Tailwind text-* plugin emits none — keep it that way.", "confidence": "high", "provenance": [{"source": "agent", "reference": "specs/017-ui-refresh self-reflect", "date": "2026-11-06"}], "tags": ["react-native", "android", "fonts", "typography", "silent-failure"], "affectedFiles": ["mobile/src/**/*.tsx", "mobile/src/theme/**/*.ts", "mobile/tailwind.config.js"], "affectedServices": [], "createdAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "updatedAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "usageCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0, "outdatedReports": 0}
{"id": "gotcha-android-colors-xml-drift-001", "type": "gotcha", "fact": "The brand colour exists in two places that nothing keeps in sync: mobile/src/theme/tokens.raw.js (JS/NativeWind) and mobile/android/app/src/main/res/values/colors.xml (native theme, cold-launch splash, adaptive-icon background). The native layer cannot read the JS token module. colorPrimary sat at #023c69 from specs/013-blue-theme-visual-design long after the JS palette had moved to Tangerine #FF6B35, and nothing failed — the drift is only visible on a cold launch.", "recommendation": "Whenever colors.primary changes in tokens.raw.js, update splashscreen_background, iconBackground and colorPrimary in android/app/src/main/res/values/colors.xml in the same commit. Treat colors.xml as a mirror of the token, not an independent value.", "confidence": "high", "provenance": [{"source": "agent", "reference": "specs/017-ui-refresh self-reflect", "date": "2026-11-06"}], "tags": ["android", "theming", "brand", "native-config"], "affectedFiles": ["mobile/src/theme/tokens.raw.js", "mobile/android/app/src/main/res/values/colors.xml"], "affectedServices": [], "createdAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "updatedAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "usageCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0, "outdatedReports": 0}
{"id": "gotcha-silent-noop-source-edit-001", "type": "gotcha", "fact": "Scripted text surgery on source files fails in two silent ways: (1) a Python str.replace()/sed substitution whose pattern does not match returns the ORIGINAL string and reports success, so the edit is recorded as applied while nothing changed — one such miss here was a single comma; (2) a loose anchor matches the wrong occurrence — rindex('  return (') matched an indented return inside a callback and truncated the rest of a screen file.", "recommendation": "When editing source with a script, assert the substitution actually happened (raise if replace() returned an unchanged string or if the occurrence count is not what you expected) and anchor on a string that is unique in the file. Prefer the Edit tool, which fails loudly on a non-match, over hand-rolled replacement.", "confidence": "high", "provenance": [{"source": "agent", "reference": "specs/017-ui-refresh self-reflect", "date": "2026-11-06"}], "tags": ["tooling", "refactoring", "agent-workflow"], "affectedFiles": ["**/*"], "affectedServices": [], "createdAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "updatedAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "usageCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0, "outdatedReports": 0}
